# Environment template

Copy to `.env` (API) / local secrets — never commit real values.

```
ConnectionStrings__Default=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=jobtracker;Username=postgres;Password=CHANGE_ME
ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development
# If using cookie auth over SPA on another origin, configure CORS + cookie carefully in Phase 1
```

Frontend example:

```
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://localhost:7XXX
```
